      <title>Ich bin kein Sexroman der sich erzählen kann [Germany, Cod Reggae/NDW/New Wave] (ca. 1980) Super-obscure self-released 7" from Germany, standing out mainly because of its funky midtempo offbeat, the cool bassline and two dulcet saxophones caressing one another.</title>
      <creator>Harald Rosenberger</creator>
      <image>https://vintageobscura.net/yt_img/Y1He7-yKSWI.jpg</image>
      <album>Sex Music</album>
