      <title>Da Slyme – Piss Eyed Sleazoid [Canada, Punk/Outsider] (1980) Formed in 1977, Da Slyme are one of the very first North American punk acts, with a broad variety of influences. Their first LP has become an extremely rare collector's item, and their style was eons ahead of its time.</title>
      <creator>Sex Music</creator>
